<view class="page"><view class="title">关于 {{item.name}}</view><view class="section-note">属于它，也属于你的生活档案。</view><view wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="label" class="entry"><view class="small muted">{{item.label}}</view><view class="body-copy">{{item.value}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{item.link}}" class="entry"><view class="small muted">购买链接</view><view class="small body-copy">{{item.link}}</view><button class="link" bindtap="copy">复制链接</button></view><view class="note section">日均持有成本 = 购入价格 ÷ 陪伴天数。<view class="line-break"/>首日计为1天，离开当天计入陪伴。维修及卖出金额单独记录，不并入日均成本。</view><button class="primary section" bindtap="edit">编辑资料</button></view>
